with $\max\limits_{t\in\mathbb{R}} \mathrm{OT}\left(t,y_0\right)$ at its maximum value and $\min\limits_{t\in\mathbb{R}} \mathrm{OT}\left(t,y_0\right)$ at its minimum value, as $y_0$ varies.

\item [3.] When  $\gamma_{1}(\widehat{y}_0)-\theta_{1}$ is a multiple of $\pi$, we have
