Each choice yields a different point since the $a^k$'s are linearly independent. Therefore, by Lemma~\ref{lemma:odd_and_even_sum}, we have		
$$|X| = \sum_{i\text{ even}} \binom{n}{i} = 2^{n-1}.$$
