queries do not have some specific Cypher features, e.g., arbitrary-length paths,
the collected dataset via translating SQL queries cannot cover these Cypher
features. Therefore, to enrich and expand our dataset, we first collect
real-world Cypher queries from open-source projects, i.e.,
