obtain 36 Cypher queries. Then, we apply three exiting Cypher
rewriting rules on these Cypher queries as follows. (1) \textbf{Renaming
variables}, which renames the variable names of node and relationship patterns.
(2) \textbf{Reversing path direction}, which reverses the relationship patterns
without changing their incoming and outgoing node patterns. (3)
\textbf{Splitting graph pattern}, which splits multiple relationship patterns in
a Cypher graph pattern.

