In this work, we present PARC (\textbf{P}hysics-based \textbf{A}ugmentation with \textbf{R}einforcement Learning for Character \textbf{C}ontrollers), an iterative data augmentation framework for training agile terrain traversal controllers for physically simulated characters. An overview of PARC is available in Figure \ref{fig:method-high}. 
