The generator $G$ receives as input the context, $\mathcal{C} = \{ \rvh, \rvd, \rvx^{1}, \rvx^{2}\}$, the noisy motion frames $\rvx_k$, and diffusion timestep $k$. The generator then predicts the clean motion sequence $\hat{\rvx}_0$,
