In this section, we detail the process for training a controller capable of executing the generated kinematic motion sequences in simulation to enable a physically simulated character to traverse complex environments. The character is controlled using a motion tracking controller, trained with reinforcement learning on the kinematically generated motions.
% talk about in next section
Our motion tracking controller follows the DeepMimic framework \cite{peng2018deepmimic}, and all physics simulations are performed using Isaac Gym \cite{makoviychuk2021isaac}.
