\begin{abstract}
We present {\tt LinApart}, a routine designed for efficiently performing the univariate partial fraction decomposition of large symbolic expressions. Our method is based on an explicit closed formula for the decomposition of rational functions with fully factorized denominators. We provide implementations in both the {\sc Wolfram Mathematica} and {\sc C} languages, made available at \url{https://github.com/fekeshazy/LinApart}. The routine can provide very significant performance gains over available tools such as the {\tt Apart} command in {\sc Mathematica}.
\end{abstract}

\begin{keyword}
partial fraction decomposition
\end{keyword}

