We compare our guided flow matching method to three baseline methods: 
\begin{enumerate}
\item \textbf{Rotation criterion}, an engineering heuristic based on the rotation velocity of the plate without beadings, which has been identified as a good placement criterion \cite{dissSebastian2022}.
\item \textbf{Random search}, where beading patterns are randomly generated based on the procedure described in~\ref{sec:beadinggeneration} and evaluated with the regression model. 
