  define a visibility function as follows:
  \[ \mathtt{proj}(N,\vfopp) :
    \begin{array}[h]{rcl}
      \Nho \cup \{\cur\} & \to & \mathcal{P}(\Nho)\\
      a\in \operatorname{dom}(\vfopp)\cap N & \mapsto & \vfopp(a) \cap N
    \end{array}\]
